From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:38:33 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net/mlx5e: Ignore FLOW_ACTION_PRIORITY on flowtable offload

The next patch makes the flowtable emit FLOW_ACTION_PRIORITY for flows
whose priority a rule set before "flow add". mlx5 would reject these
rules and stop offloading flows it offloads today.

The eswitch does not use skb->priority for these flows, so accept the
action on flowtable flows and ignore it. tc flower rules with skbedit
priority are still rejected.

As a result, the priority only reaches packets on the software fast
path. Packets of a flow offloaded to the FDB do not carry it. Rejecting
the action instead would keep the whole flow in software.

Reviewed-by: Jianbo Liu <jianbol@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>
Original-author: Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

---
 .../net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/Makefile  |  3 ++-
 .../mellanox/mlx5/core/en/tc/act/act.c        |  1 +
 .../mellanox/mlx5/core/en/tc/act/act.h        |  1 +
 .../mlx5/core/en/tc/act/skbedit_prio.c        | 22 +++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/en/tc/act/skbedit_prio.c

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/Makefile
@@ -55,7 +55,8 @@ mlx5_core-$(CONFIG_MLX5_CLS_ACT)     +=
 					en/tc/act/vlan.o en/tc/act/vlan_mangle.o en/tc/act/mpls.o \
 					en/tc/act/mirred.o en/tc/act/mirred_nic.o \
 					en/tc/act/ct.o en/tc/act/sample.o en/tc/act/ptype.o \
-					en/tc/act/redirect_ingress.o en/tc/act/police.o
+					en/tc/act/redirect_ingress.o en/tc/act/police.o \
+					en/tc/act/skbedit_prio.o
 
 ifneq ($(CONFIG_MLX5_TC_CT),)
 	mlx5_core-y			     += en/tc_ct.o en/tc/ct_fs_dmfs.o
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/en/tc/act/act.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/en/tc/act/act.c
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ static struct mlx5e_tc_act *tc_acts_fdb[
 	[FLOW_ACTION_ADD] = &mlx5e_tc_act_pedit,
 	[FLOW_ACTION_CSUM] = &mlx5e_tc_act_csum,
 	[FLOW_ACTION_PTYPE] = &mlx5e_tc_act_ptype,
+	[FLOW_ACTION_PRIORITY] = &mlx5e_tc_act_skbedit_prio,
 	[FLOW_ACTION_SAMPLE] = &mlx5e_tc_act_sample,
 	[FLOW_ACTION_POLICE] = &mlx5e_tc_act_police,
 	[FLOW_ACTION_CT] = &mlx5e_tc_act_ct,
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/en/tc/act/act.h
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/en/tc/act/act.h
@@ -81,6 +81,7 @@ extern struct mlx5e_tc_act mlx5e_tc_act_
 extern struct mlx5e_tc_act mlx5e_tc_act_tun_encap;
 extern struct mlx5e_tc_act mlx5e_tc_act_tun_decap;
 extern struct mlx5e_tc_act mlx5e_tc_act_csum;
+extern struct mlx5e_tc_act mlx5e_tc_act_skbedit_prio;
 extern struct mlx5e_tc_act mlx5e_tc_act_pedit;
 extern struct mlx5e_tc_act mlx5e_tc_act_vlan;
 extern struct mlx5e_tc_act mlx5e_tc_act_vlan_mangle;
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/mellanox/mlx5/core/en/tc/act/skbedit_prio.c
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0 OR Linux-OpenIB
+
+#include "act.h"
+#include "en/tc_priv.h"
+
+static int
+tc_act_parse_skbedit_prio(struct mlx5e_tc_act_parse_state *parse_state,
+			  const struct flow_action_entry *act,
+			  struct mlx5e_priv *priv,
+			  struct mlx5_flow_attr *attr)
+{
+	/* The eswitch does not apply skb->priority to flowtable flows. */
+	if (mlx5e_is_ft_flow(parse_state->flow))
+		return 0;
+
+	NL_SET_ERR_MSG_MOD(parse_state->extack, "skbedit priority is not supported");
+	return -EOPNOTSUPP;
+}
+
+struct mlx5e_tc_act mlx5e_tc_act_skbedit_prio = {
+	.parse_action = tc_act_parse_skbedit_prio,
+};
